- # Morning Briefing — Cron Job Template
- # Runs the full 4-step AI Persona OS daily protocol
- # Schedule: Daily at 8 AM (adjust timezone)
- #
- # Usage:
- #   Copy and paste the command below into your terminal.
- #   Change --tz to your timezone.
